      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The preoperative single-dose oral administration of a combination of rapid- and slow-release diclofenac (Voltaren, Ciba-Geigy, Basel, Switzerland) preparation in a placebo-controlled trial proved to be more effective in postoperative pain prevention following third molar removal than the combination of intramuscular diclofenac and an oral depot formula."},
